   120	For monic `L=-b+l2*x^2+...+l_(m-1)*x^(m-1)+x^m`, start with `P=p*x^(2m)`. The coefficient of the next P_j in row `x^(2m+j)` is
   121	
   122	```text
   123	A_j=2(2m+j-3)p+3/2
   124	   =(2m+j+6d)/(2(2d+1)).
