    55	## 2. The first arrow fails by the ordinary chain rule
    56	
    57	Use throughout `[f,g]_(x,y)=f_x g_y-f_y g_x`. If
    58	`[P,Q]_(gamma,pi)=c gamma^k` and
    59	
