   733	because the previous template had lanes write the `<!-- BODY-END -->`
   734	seal into the initial skeleton — making `report_state=BODY_SEALED`
   735	unable to distinguish a finished report from a crashed one.
   736	
   737	Binding contract for every future lane prompt:
   738	
   739	1. The skeleton written as the lane's first action MUST NOT contain the
   740	   `<!-- BODY-END -->` marker.
   741	2. Sections are appended as separate bounded writes (target under
   742	   ~1,500 words per write; never the whole report in one response).
   743	3. The standalone `<!-- BODY-END -->` line is appended only after the
   744	   final section is on disk, with nothing after it.
   745	4. If the budget runs short: finish the current section, type every
   746	   remaining section OPEN in one short paragraph each, then seal.
   747	
