   749	or under-delivered lanes, and the divert machinery banks their partial
   750	content. Coordinator-side: a `BODY_SEALED` receipt no longer implies
   751	substance; harvest still requires reading the report. Queued ops debt
   752	(nonblocking): a divert heuristic flagging sealed reports whose
